    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20937" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hŏrīzon</span></b> , ontis,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁρίζων</span> (sc.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύκλος</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀήρ</span>). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The horizon</i> (pure Lat. finiens and finitor),
					<i><span class="en">Macr. Somn. Scip. 1, 15 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. S.
				7, 14 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg.
				Astr. 1, 4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A line drawn through the centre of a sundial</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Vitr. 9,
				8</span></i>.</div>
